  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks (peel if preferred) and place on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with All-American spice blend, a pinch of salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d48e7b2ec1b0eb362/step-76343600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic and corn until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and salt, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d48e7b2ec1b0eb362/step-7b764d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 5 mins remaining, in a large bowl, combine baby spinach and drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d48e7b2ec1b0eb362/step-38988620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice and spinach between bowls.\n• Top with smokey roast pumpkin, crumble over fetta cubes and drizzle with dill & parsley mayonnaise to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee7d48e7b2ec1b0eb362/step-e1c20830.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
